<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 30, 2026</p>
<p><strong>Application:</strong> CBT Sleep - Insomnia Therapy</p>
<p><strong>Package ID:</strong> <span class="pkg">com.liyonelec.cbtsleep</span></p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>This privacy policy outlines how Liyonelec handles user information for CBT Sleep - Insomnia Therapy mobile application. We prioritize user privacy and keep all personal usage data stored locally on user devices.</p>

<h2>2. Data Collection & Storage</h2>
<p>We do not collect, upload, share or sell any personally identifiable information including full name, email address, phone number, location or other private user data to our servers or any third-party platforms.</p>
<p>All sleep journals, CBT therapy progress records and application configuration settings are saved locally on your Android device only. All stored data will be permanently deleted once you uninstall the application or clear app storage.</p>

<h2>3. In-App Purchase Information</h2>
<p>This application supports official Google Play In-App Purchases to unlock premium features.</p>
<ul>
    <li>All payment information, billing details and credit card credentials are fully processed and managed by Google Play.</li>
    <li>We have no access to your private payment data and never store any transaction financial information.</li>
    <li>We only receive anonymous purchase validation results from Google to activate purchased premium content without any attached personal details.</li>
</ul>
<p>All payment activities are governed by Google’s official privacy terms.</p>

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>The app only integrates Google Play Billing service required for in-app purchases. No advertisement SDK, user behavior analytics SDK or location tracking service is embedded inside this application.</p>

<h2>5. Your Data Rights</h2>
<ul>
    <li>You may view, modify or erase all your local saved data directly within the app at any moment.</li>
    <li>Clearing app storage or uninstalling the software removes all your private data completely.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Age Eligibility</h2>
<p>This application is designed for users aged 18 and above. We never intentionally collect personal information from users under 13 years old.</p>

<h2>7. Policy Updates</h2>
<p>We reserve the right to revise this privacy policy as needed. Revised terms will be published on this page automatically. Your continued use of CBT Sleep constitutes acceptance of updated policy content.</p>

<h2>8. Contact Information</h2>
<p>For privacy related inquiries, please send an email to: <strong>liyonelectronics@gmail.com</strong></p>
